                <l xml:id="m-4f9c9490-d659-49ea-9462-abbc3b66c6bb" facs="#m-d1ae20e2-4be2-49fc-af26-cbe4b7e5ae0a" label="text-like">The Solemn evening Mas¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8f2bb81-a81c-4db9-812c-4fcb677b5ca7" facs="#m-ce485ea8-87f1-4e78-8f45-cb600f69a2ba" label="ambiguous">683</l><l xml:id="m-80fe27c2-cd33-4d6a-826d-97c94fae1a01" facs="#m-3698b37c-3506-4b7c-84bb-a111e2d74175" label="lyrics-like">19. Heródii dómus dux est eórum: t móntes excélsi cérvis:</l><l xml:id="m-5a7325cb-8580-4f32-a06b-99cad76a6228" facs="#m-8421c54b-b82b-4049-91eb-a573eacbe52c" label="lyrics-like">pétra refúgium herináciis.</l><l xml:id="m-335c809f-5d59-4bd2-afbe-d8d233c66d34" facs="#m-4a979c1b-c7dd-45c6-bfef-134a52711d67" label="lyrics-like">20. Fécit lúnam in témpora:“sol cognóvit occásum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-97644bdd-f1af-40e9-b326-978a5acc37ac" facs="#m-bded613f-213e-4b58-b0f6-4a550aa74472" label="lyrics-like">21. Posuisti ténebras, et fácta est no:*n ipsa pertranssbunt</l><l xml:id="m-2d9a6c75-e57b-44ff-8cef-cd8be233b54d" facs="#m-2dd77ddb-2355-4f75-9bde-1e4444e296e6" label="lyrics-like">ómnes béstide silvae.</l><l xml:id="m-2219d793-b749-4262-968b-674909d8631b" facs="#m-7738ba37-450a-493a-8d93-31c078496cbf" label="lyrics-like">22. Cátuli leónum rugiéntes, ut rápiant, “ et quaérant a Déo</l><l xml:id="m-d9489d0b-d537-42fb-a507-bf25900e8c52" facs="#m-7ce3dd92-0736-4947-8fbf-3f843ca95afb" label="lyrics-like">éscam sibi.</l><l xml:id="m-430ea226-fe27-44b4-baa0-3f8a9e1ed377" facs="#m-009716c3-d551-428b-96a1-0b91de8aec36" label="lyrics-like">23. ortus est sol, et congregáti sunt: *et in cubslibus suis</l><l xml:id="m-4c61cceb-25bd-40b2-9cd2-7d8ecb35ae17" facs="#m-3f394273-f439-4175-90ba-acf9411947b9" label="lyrics-like">collocabúntur.</l><l xml:id="m-7ba24d72-6014-48cc-955d-d5848468b51b" facs="#m-f5bd4b23-09e5-4519-947d-4599bc74bd88" label="lyrics-like">24. Exibit hómo ad ópus súum: “ et ad operatiónem súam</l><l xml:id="m-6b697f89-ad41-49fa-b1d4-05a408767904" facs="#m-73fa0902-330e-48bf-877f-5bda771b3a85" label="lyrics-like">usque ad vésperum.</l><l xml:id="m-2243a1d9-ead0-4111-8848-67b9875b782b" facs="#m-faa34d10-e04a-48ae-b0e6-7c5a96aa289b" label="lyrics-like">25. Quam magnificáta sunt ópera túa, Dómine! ! ómnia in</l><l xml:id="m-9a45c987-de14-433f-b3da-2e6e6e245ec8" facs="#m-476907da-48c9-4301-9c69-c57247eac514" label="lyrics-like">sapiéntia fecisti : "impléta est térra possessióne túa.</l><l xml:id="m-72a1c955-10e4-4c33-8053-5ebe712c09f7" facs="#m-3bc916f8-e76a-4346-bd7d-239e6fc04e07" label="lyrics-like">26. Hoc máre mágnum, et spatiósum mánibus: “illic reptflia,</l><l xml:id="m-454296ec-c3e7-4a87-9094-0a894cac17c9" facs="#m-1ea8b2ab-ee05-464d-a966-bbc21f791c85" label="lyrics-like">quórum non est númerus.</l><l xml:id="m-e580a069-c877-406c-a45c-986daa891e81" facs="#m-a2d7db19-4273-4d42-8641-bbd93b340ec1" label="lyrics-like">27. Animália pusflla cum mágnis: * illic náves pertransibunt.</l><l xml:id="m-4f1c3c50-4c5b-4db6-bfc6-3315be954204" facs="#m-6b17aac2-7987-439a-8158-cf85861e753c" label="lyrics-like">28. Dráco iste, quem formásti ad illudéndum éi: * ómnia a te</l><l xml:id="m-2f9a0b55-5725-4a5e-b16c-8d664b70183a" facs="#m-a3bf4616-3eae-483a-a428-32aaced726c5" label="lyrics-like">exspéctant ut des sllis éscam in témpore.</l><l xml:id="m-c09e6bae-8541-4dac-8cc1-dd54bfdb8609" facs="#m-8b7d9665-c417-4464-8c04-4a51d20cbf5e" label="lyrics-like">29. Dánte te fllis, cólligent: “aperiénte te mánum túam,</l><l xml:id="m-1b84d877-db44-4054-8e0c-4211f25303e5" facs="#m-4e8e774f-ed69-4f61-a7c4-71c9d8f4a489" label="lyrics-like">ómnia implebúntur bonitáte.</l><l xml:id="m-8d4f28a9-0a7d-45ae-b151-2615b32e7091" facs="#m-93c692f1-1814-404a-9dbe-82af1f5dd62c" label="lyrics-like">30. Averténte autem te fáciem, turbabúntur:t áuferes spiritum</l><l xml:id="m-bac38da2-abdc-48fa-afc5-a7ad05a0e8ed" facs="#m-8858f545-dab4-422b-aaef-93e8a10dd3d5" label="lyrics-like">córum, et deficient, * et in púlverem suum reverténtur.</l><l xml:id="m-8dd1f352-94b0-4c2f-8af3-7af172a815f9" facs="#m-2ae8e745-ea35-4417-a003-1d8cdd0d3f20" label="lyrics-like">31. Emittes spiritum túum, et creabúntur:“ et renovábis</l><l xml:id="m-2e582cdb-496d-43ee-b3ef-8305fbdbc2f3" facs="#m-836fc14f-4556-4e0b-b383-bf72619f6a31" label="lyrics-like">fáciem térrae.</l><l xml:id="m-522bdfe8-1067-4d5a-8f1c-f061d4e864ea" facs="#m-2c0299ba-3d53-4c7b-9353-700af340698e" label="lyrics-like">32. Sit glória Dómini in saéculum: “ laetábitur Dóminus in</l><l xml:id="m-8bbab85b-03ae-4713-9eaa-977c7c97d89b" facs="#m-ccfea084-cbe9-40d8-98f8-497a722a6da1" label="lyrics-like">opéribus súis:</l><l xml:id="m-0415b349-a213-41c1-a2d6-13147be47e71" facs="#m-48fc0895-f314-414d-b68a-4c2aa8cf38a9" label="lyrics-like">33. Qui réspicit térram, et fácit éam trémere:“qui tángit</l><l xml:id="m-6d6b18f2-78bf-4420-9094-21a4ee3dd2ab" facs="#m-c1f6fdf0-9d6a-41d4-a9a4-02f754723d3b" label="lyrics-like">móntes, et fúmigant.</l><l xml:id="m-78f6eec1-5f8e-47a7-9f81-4421d2ebb661" facs="#m-473d6e82-0b38-4f63-92cd-5974e10003e7" label="lyrics-like">34. Cantábo Dómino in vita méa:“psállam Déo méo quámdiu</l><l xml:id="m-3b68d0ba-be54-4c17-a3bf-b80280b280a9" facs="#m-18c0a3f6-dd0f-4c0d-9b9c-9ae95d18197b" label="ambiguous">sum.</l><l xml:id="m-c3b610b2-9154-46b5-9591-f2699fe8be5a" facs="#m-8623580d-42cf-4f1b-bfde-7273d26015fa" label="lyrics-like">35. Jucúndum sit éi elóquium méum: * égo vero delectábor</l><l xml:id="m-cca75730-57e7-4a12-8a31-3ae8cca5a026" facs="#m-c94caee8-6a4e-463d-b28d-06e67ae82b03" label="lyrics-like">in Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-7e4168f1-3e30-4052-89fc-0d7e781803f3" facs="#m-d95f5a5b-97d7-4507-97f7-de086122f279" label="lyrics-like">36. Deficiant peccatóres a térra, et iniqui ita ut non sint:</l><l xml:id="m-2b05d02d-1373-427b-9554-17c19c3f303b" facs="#m-def78f32-af50-4719-89cd-3ec1affcc918" label="lyrics-like">bénedic, ánima méa, Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-80cddc58-a0ee-40f1-b40b-f13d11d449d8" facs="#m-4dd4ee1e-5917-401e-af9f-69be503f4c35" label="lyrics-like">The antiphon Dóminus Jésus. is repeated, as above.</l><l xml:id="m-09fcc22f-9d8f-47b9-892f-2e0dc7e5e043" facs="#m-2f67da4d-4b48-4ceb-a4be-e761edc66dd1" label="ambiguous">Psalm 150 (New psalter, p. 43*)</l><l xml:id="m-db7fc853-6660-4058-83c2-5c9d55f6fbcb" facs="#m-e33c15bf-232e-4dca-9023-6b7877621ac8" label="text-like">A solemn chorus of the praise of God</l><l xml:id="m-010b9c6c-be13-48a3-8058-69d962da4996" facs="#m-bddf1378-1b4f-4ab3-801f-ad3af728f150" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum in sánctis é¬ jus: “ laudá-te</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>